          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenirós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "/Ameenirós:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a /ameenír hatlá', a hareerooká, ala a /ameenír nee hhawaata tawoó alhootá'.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tidá' quturmo wasl, umuuwós a Reuma, inós sleeme guri na/ií xwayluúr. Na/iiká' a Teba, nee Gahamu, nee Tahashi nee Ma'aka.",
          "type": "text",
